{"id":"01a0657e-024c-7ab5-a042-7ee18e10ba68","chapterSlug":"rw8-08 J","paragraph":627,"wording":"[Senator]","event":"named","holderSlug":"lyfelt","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"nomna","holderQuote":"“If he wants to be a [Royal Advisor]—do I think he would sell out Jecrass? No. But Lyfelt is ambitious. He would never settle to be a [Senator] when he could be a [Prime Minister]. He probably thinks you’re his last avenue to safety and power after what happened. I don’t think he’d ever betray you. He was Raelt’s friend. He can be ruthless, but he doesn’t betray. Or so I thought. After I saw those Gnolls…I don’t know.”"}
